# deadpool_le 1.14 - drafted by port_tool.py from deadpool_pro-1.16.port (item 138): all 17 functions
# and 13 globals placed by strict signature; its end of ball is also the function its hook 0x34 handler
# calls. Emulator-proven 2026-09-24 (three runs of census_mode.c + template_mode.c on a copy of the
# 1.14.0 card): the runtime armed, every one of the 25 shots below came from the switch its name says,
# TARGET RUSH started on the third Lil Deadpool target and ended on its clock and on a drain
# (END (ball ended)), and every event below fired when it should. Its event bus is two ids smaller than
# Godzilla's (cmp r0, #205), and so are its tilt ids: 0xc6 is the warning here, 0xc4 the tilt.
# Callouts heard in the emulator 2026-09-25 (item 164, the item 163 pipeline): countdown.
game           deadpool_le
version        1.14

